IdempotencyFormula.description:
How an action's idempotency key derives (§6.3). NAMED here; the real key derivation + the
dedup store are 2.3. `None` = not idempotent; `FromInputs` = derived from the input payload;
`NaturalResourceRef` = the targeted resource is the natural key.

ResourceRef.description:
A reference to a resource an action reads/mutates (§6.2 ResourceRef; AG §9.8). The leaner
binding set `{type, id, uri?}` — AG's `displayName?` is resolvable from `id` (DEFERRED;
additive-later if a consumer needs it).
